{
  "id": "workout-replan-sealed-holdout-v4",
  "split": "sealed_holdout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "legacy-history-and-new-cycle",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "今天原来没做的先作废吧，热身和各项两组的旧记录留档，重新安排十九分钟。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "done_sets": 7
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "同意放弃原方案未练部分，只把已练的保留下来，新目标先给预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 7,
            "max_minutes": 19
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "预览我认可了，确认应用这份新目标。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "我还没动新安排，旧完成记录总共几组，新方案的进度几组？请分别列。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "explain_separation": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "live-partial-preview-defer-and-apply",
      "fixture": "partial_active",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "只做了已记录那组，其他旧目标取消，已做照常留档，换一套十五分钟的新目标。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "old_status": "active",
            "done_sets": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "对，保留那组，旧未完成部分放弃，先预览新的，应用另说。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "old_status": "active",
            "done_sets": 1,
            "max_minutes": 15
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "先放着别应用，我再看下，旧的现在先别改。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "old_status": "active",
            "done_sets": 1,
            "max_minutes": 15
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "我看完了，现在确认应用这套十五分钟的。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "old_status": "superseded",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 1,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "留档那组和新目标分别怎么记录的？我还没有开始新这套。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 1,
            "completed": false,
            "explain_separation": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}